WEBVTT

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.079
we simply haven't met the test,
of giving all and saving none

00:11:03.103 --> 00:11:04.826
until the game is really won;

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:07.244
of showing what is meant by grit;

00:11:07.268 --> 00:11:09.348
of playing through when others quit;

00:11:09.372 --> 00:11:11.076
of playing through, not letting up.

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.839
It's bearing down that wins the cup.

00:11:12.863 --> 00:11:16.220
Of dreaming there's a goal ahead;
of hoping when our dreams are dead;

00:11:16.244 --> 00:11:19.976
of praying when our hopes have fled;
yet losing, not afraid to fall,

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.811
if, bravely, we have given all.

00:11:21.835 --> 00:11:25.690
For who can ask more of a man
than giving all within his span.

00:11:25.714 --> 00:11:29.976
Giving all, it seems to me,
is not so far from victory.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.286
And so the Fates are seldom wrong,
no matter how they twist and wind.